      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fill only the person, three times\n\nSAM marks the person. Each FILL PASS repaints that area, then KEEP OUTSIDE pastes the original photo back everywhere outside the mask, so the rest of the frame never drifts. Pass 1 clears the person. Pass 2 and pass 3 settle the texture. If a rim of the person remains, raise the first number on FILL MASK. If the fill looks invented, lower the denoise on FILL PASS 3."
      ]
